@host = http://localhost:5080

### Upload a photo (JPEG, PNG or WebP, up to 10 MB); the response has id, url and thumbnailUrl
POST {{host}}/api/v1/images
X-Requested-With: fetch
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----rl

------rl
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photo.jpg
------rl--

### Download the full rendition
GET {{host}}/api/v1/images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005

### Download the thumbnail
GET {{host}}/api/v1/images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005?size=thumb
